msgid "Barrio Suite Mailchimp"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php
msgid "Adds who fills in a Barrio Suite form to a Mailchimp audience."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php
msgid "Hellobarrio"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:31
msgid "Adds who fills in the form to a Mailchimp audience, or updates the contact if it is already there."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:35
msgid "API key"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:36
msgid "From Profile → Extras → API keys in Mailchimp. It ends with the data center, like -us21."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:43
msgid "Audience ID"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:44
msgid "From Audience → Settings → Audience name and defaults. It can be different in every language."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:48
msgid "Email field"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:54
msgid "Ask to confirm by email (double opt-in)"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:55
msgid "Subscribe without confirmation"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:57
msgid "New contacts"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:58
msgid "Without a choice, Mailchimp emails new contacts a link to confirm. Subscribe without confirmation only if the form collects an explicit consent."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:62
msgid "Merge fields"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:63
msgid "The Mailchimp merge tag, like FNAME or PHONE, and the field that fills it. Choices are sent with their label."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:68
msgid "Tags"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:69
msgid "Added to every contact; separated by commas."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:73
msgid "Marketing consent field"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:74
msgid "The contact is added anyway; the consent tags only when this field is checked. To add only who consents, use the conditional logic."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:79
msgid "Consent tags"
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:80
msgid "Added only when the marketing consent field is checked; separated by commas."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:101
msgid "the API key is missing or not valid (Settings)."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:104
msgid "the audience ID is missing."
msgstr ""

#: barrio-suite-mailchimp.php:109
msgid "no email address: the email field is empty or not chosen."
msgstr ""

